{"1921330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Echo Wars - Road Rage", "steam_appid": 1921330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921330/extras/bc241e6e567c0d9396e7095f11869228.poster.avif?t=1761227552\" width=600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921330/extras/bc241e6e567c0d9396e7095f11869228.webm?t=1761227552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Echo Wars</strong> is a VR arcade game that doesn’t waste your time: you jump into your buggy, grab your weapon, and everything starts blowing up. Drive with one hand, shoot with the other, and get ready for a series of spectacular levels featuring giant enemies, extreme environments, and mechanics that evolve in every stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921330/extras/e0daf140fe81bc4be0acad98a9b24f60.poster.avif?t=1761227552\" width=600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921330/extras/e0daf140fe81bc4be0acad98a9b24f60.webm?t=1761227552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>From collapsing futuristic cities to icy landscapes crawling with lethal creatures, through volcanic tunnels, space circuits, egg-infested laboratories, and cursed mines—there’s no pause here, only well-orchestrated chaos. And if you’re looking for a real challenge, Brutal Mode will make you sweat like it’s the arcade glory days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echo Wars is compatible with both VR and flat screens (including Steam Deck), and it’s perfect for short bursts of adrenaline or full-blown arcade marathons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921330/extras/3d849049d17b5697ba6ebcdf93d619eb.poster.avif?t=1761227552\" width=600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921330/extras/3d849049d17b5697ba6ebcdf93d619eb.webm?t=1761227552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative anti-rotation system that completely eliminates motion sickness in VR.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with force feedback wheels and motion platforms (PC exclusive).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable in VR or on flat screens, with support for ultra-widescreen and Steam Deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique mechanic: drive with one hand and shoot with the other.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 levels with varied objectives and three difficulty settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack composed by Ricardo Fermín.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921330/extras/bc241e6e567c0d9396e7095f11869228.poster.avif?t=1761227552\" width=600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921330/extras/bc241e6e567c0d9396e7095f11869228.webm?t=1761227552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Echo Wars</strong> is a VR arcade game that doesn’t waste your time: you jump into your buggy, grab your weapon, and everything starts blowing up. Drive with one hand, shoot with the other, and get ready for a series of spectacular levels featuring giant enemies, extreme environments, and mechanics that evolve in every stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921330/extras/e0daf140fe81bc4be0acad98a9b24f60.poster.avif?t=1761227552\" width=600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921330/extras/e0daf140fe81bc4be0acad98a9b24f60.webm?t=1761227552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>From collapsing futuristic cities to icy landscapes crawling with lethal creatures, through volcanic tunnels, space circuits, egg-infested laboratories, and cursed mines—there’s no pause here, only well-orchestrated chaos. And if you’re looking for a real challenge, Brutal Mode will make you sweat like it’s the arcade glory days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echo Wars is compatible with both VR and flat screens (including Steam Deck), and it’s perfect for short bursts of adrenaline or full-blown arcade marathons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921330/extras/3d849049d17b5697ba6ebcdf93d619eb.poster.avif?t=1761227552\" width=600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1921330/extras/3d849049d17b5697ba6ebcdf93d619eb.webm?t=1761227552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative anti-rotation system that completely eliminates motion sickness in VR.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with force feedback wheels and motion platforms (PC exclusive).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playab